{
  "about": "Harder eval questions, written after both prompt versions scored 41/41 on test_set.json. Each one targets a mistake seen in real answers: inventing data, claiming actions the agent can't take, ignoring a tie, losing track of a conversation, or searching for data that doesn't exist. 'turns' are earlier messages sent in the same conversation before the question. 'must_not_mention' fails the case if any phrase appears; 'max_tool_calls' fails it if the agent used more tool calls than that.",
